#4471 merged every date report into one known issue. They are not one bug.

The shared parser reads a day-first date month-first, so the day and the month trade places. On booking-v3 the form prints `MM/DD/YYYY` and then reads the tenant's day-first order. That is a different bug, and it only shows up on the form. A few reports move a booking by a day. The desk listed those ids in `oneDayMove`. They are not the swap, and #4471 still holds them.

